                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very under polished Lemmings clone. The gameplay itself isn't that bad, but nothing unique is really going on here.\n[list]\n    [*]The ninjas start moving immediately after placing the first item, which makes levels needlessly annoying/difficult sometimes. A speed up button also would've been nice.\n    [*]The UI/font and graphics as a whole are just an eye sore. The art style is very inconsistent - some of the images, especially of the leaves/grass, just look they were ripped right off Google images.\n    [*]No options menu.\n[/list]",
